### ============================================
### AUTH
### ============================================

### Request OTP (check the `nest start` terminal for the code — dev mode logs it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "{{phoneNumber}}"
}

### Verify OTP — copy the accessToken from the response into the variable above
# @name verifyOtp
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "{{phoneNumber}}",
  "code": "64085"
}

### Refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}


### ============================================
### CATEGORIES
### ============================================

### List categories (public, no auth needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### Get one category
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}

### Create category (needs Category:manage permission)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "translations": [
    { "locale": "fa", "name": "لوازم آرایشی و بهداشتی", "slug": "cosmetics" }
  ]
}

### Delete category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ============================================
### PRODUCTS
### ============================================

### List products (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Get one product
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### Create product (needs Product:manage permission)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "sku": "RACE-TEST-002",
  "price": 100000,
  "stock": 8,
  "translations": [{ "locale": "fa", "name": "Race Test", "slug": "race-test2" }]
}

### Delete product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Upload product image
# Note: file upload needs multipart — REST Client supports it, see docs if needed,
# but for image uploads curl (or Postman) is honestly still easier day to day.


### ============================================
### CART
### ============================================

### Get cart (works logged in OR as guest — REST Client auto-handles cookies per file)
GET {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Add item to cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Update item quantity
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### Remove item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart/items/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Clear cart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ============================================
### ADDRESSES
### ============================================

### List my addresses
GET {{baseUrl}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create address — copy the returned id into @addressId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/addresses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{ "name": "Home", 
"province": "Tehran", 
"city": "Tehran", 
"line1": "Test St 2", 
"postalCode": "2222222222" 
}

### Delete address
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ============================================
### CHECKOUT
### ============================================

### Checkout current cart into a real order
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "addressId": "{{addressId}}"
}


### ============================================
### RBAC PROOF (from Phase 1)
### ============================================

### No token — expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles

### With token — expect 403 for a Customer role, 200 for Shop Manager/Super Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
